      "user_id": 82319,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764789745866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Certainly. I can help with that. Let me just pull up your order. To make sure I direct this correctly, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764789750799999
    },
    {
